  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Marco
    Text: When everything got settled down I came out here to clear my head. I have
      not seen anything beyond that. I am but a simple jester. I just do not think
      of any joke I can say to make this situation better.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: 1919691424312299089, guid: 3dc94aacbc1d6b94db175170fd85926c, type: 3}
  ParentNodes: []
  ChildNode: {fileID: 0}
