  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Marco
    Text: Adrianne sobbing woke up Avant. Avant immediately roused Sebastian. But
      what were Allistair and Charles doing up at such a time, and how did they know
      where to go? It striked me as odd.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: 1919691424312299089, guid: 3dc94aacbc1d6b94db175170fd85926c, type: 3}
  ParentNodes:
